       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Ben Pennell",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "attrs": {
           "accessLevel": "",
           "id": "60785e2552404d0070bf1d34",
           "text": "@Danny Bernstein"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": " I'm not quite sure what the expected outcome for this ticket is. Do we want `Want-Digest: sha-256` to produce `Digest: sha256=blahblahlblah`?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "\"sha-256\" appears to be the algorithm name expected by internal java libraries, so we would have to do some translation on the way out. I don't see any reason we can't retain the - in the urn specification, and my instinct would be to keep the keys matching on the input and output, but I don't feel strongly if there is reason to change it.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "As a bonus, there is an existing test that explicitly expects `sha256` to fail when requesting digests:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/integration/kernel/modeshape/FedoraBinaryImplIT.java#L389"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/integration/kernel/modeshape/FedoraBinaryImplIT.java#L389",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
