     "body": "<p>I have updated the documentation from sha256 to sha-256:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Containers\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Containers</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Fixity\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Fixity</a></p>",
