  "description": "<p>1. Create a binary: &lt;resource&gt;</p>\n\n<p>2. `curl -I -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin &lt;resource&gt; -H \"Want-Digest: sha-256\"`</p>\n\n<p>3. verify that the Digest response header looks like this</p>\n\n<p>`Digest: sha256=&lt;checksum&gt;`</p>\n\n<p>instead of like this</p>\n\n<p>`Digest: sha-256=&lt;checksum&gt;`</p>",
